@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title 001 活動與組別進場：類別圖（技術層）

enum "階段 (Phase)" as Phase {
  preparing
  open
  closed
}

note bottom of Phase
  preparing = 準備中；open = 搶答中；closed = 已結束
end note

enum "身分種類 (Role)" as Role {
  guest
  student
  teacher
}

note bottom of Role
  guest = 訪客；student = 學生；teacher = 老師
end note

class "活動 (ActivityState)" as ActivityState {
  phase : Phase
  openedAt : string|null
  countdownEndsAt : string|null
  closedAt : string|null
  --
  open(activity, groupCount, now, countdownSeconds?) : ActivityTransition
  close(activity, now) : ActivityTransition
  reset(activity, confirm) : ActivityTransition
}

class "活動資料列 (Activity)" as ActivityRecord {
  id : number
  phase : Phase
  openedAt : string|null
  countdownEndsAt : string|null
  closedAt : string|null
  revision : number
}

class "組別 (GroupRegistryEntry)" as GroupEntry {
  id : string
  name : string
  position : number
}

class "持久化組別 (Group)" as GroupRecord {
  id : string
  name : string
  position : number
}

class "組別名冊 (groupRegistry.ts 純函式)" as Registry {
  createGroup(phase, groups, name, generateId?) : GroupRegistryResult
  renameGroup(phase, groups, groupId, name) : GroupRegistryResult
  deleteGroup(phase, groups, groupId) : GroupRegistryResult
}

class "參與者 (AccessIdentity)" as Participant <<union>> {
  role : 'guest'|'student'|'teacher'
  groupId : string（僅 StudentIdentity）
}

class "身分憑據 (Session)" as Session {
  tokenHash : string
  role : SessionRole
  groupId : string|null
  createdAt : string
}

class "活動狀態快照 (Snapshot)" as Snapshot <<union>> {
  revision : number
  serverNow : string
  phase : Phase
  countdownEndsAt : string|null
  groups : GroupSummary[]
  role : 'guest'|'student'|'teacher'
  myGroupId : string（僅 StudentSnapshot）
  presence : Record<string, number>（僅 TeacherSnapshot）
}

class "組別摘要 (GroupSummary)" as GroupSummary {
  id : string
  name : string
}

ActivityState --> Phase : phase
ActivityRecord --> Phase : phase
Registry --> Phase : phase 參數
Registry --> GroupEntry : groups : GroupRegistryEntry[]
GroupRecord ..> GroupEntry : 欄位相同，作為參數傳入
Participant --> Role : role
Participant ..> GroupRecord : student 的 groupId
Session --> Role : role（SessionRole = 不含 guest）
Session ..> Participant : resolveIdentity() 的來源
Snapshot --> Phase : phase
Snapshot --> Role : role
Snapshot --> GroupSummary : groups
GroupRecord ..> GroupSummary : createSnapshot() 映射 id、name
ActivityRecord ..> Snapshot : createSnapshot() 提供 phase / countdownEndsAt / revision

note bottom of ActivityState
  規則（server/src/domain/activity.ts）：
  1. 階段只能依序前進
  2. 開啟前至少要有一個組別
  3. 只有「已結束」可以重設
  4. 重複 open／close 回覆成功但 changed = false
end note

note bottom of ActivityRecord
  server/src/infra/db/activityRepo.ts。
  domain 操作的是不含 id、revision 的 ActivityState；
  revision 由指令或 presence 變更在應用層加 1。
end note

note right of Registry
  規則（server/src/domain/groupRegistry.ts）：
  1. 只有「準備中」可以修改
  2. 名稱去除前後空白後為 1–30 個字且不重複
  3. 最多 50 組
  程式沒有名為 GroupRegistry 的類別；名冊是 GroupRegistryEntry[]。
end note

note bottom of Participant
  AccessIdentity = GuestIdentity | StudentIdentity | TeacherIdentity
  （server/src/app/access.ts）。
  「是否在線」不是 Session 或身分欄位；broadcaster.ts 以
  connectedStudents: Map<string, number> 統計，
  只有 TeacherSnapshot 另有 presence: Record<string, number>。
end note
@enduml
